f?t=1729257086\" width=540 height=960 /></span><br><br>Also, the game offers a proper Tate mode for player with vertical mounted screens.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912910/extras/3ef379f187a536d4d66e31808952b180.poster.avif?t=1729257086\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912910/extras/3ef379f187a536d4d66e31808952b180.webm?t=1729257086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912910/extras/3ef379f187a536d4d66e31808952b180.mp4?t=1729257086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912910/extras/5d4258c2af48f154f981bf88dd882e93.avif?t=1729257086\" width=564 height=180 /></span><br><br>Each game has a story, even a super &quot;arcady &quot;vertical shooter. In Shockwave Triggers, you have to save your little sister from the Empire who kidnaped her. Somehow, they have a certain use for her in their plan to dominate this post apocalyptic world that relies on crystals to get power.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912910/extras/784e915204c80b284feb5041d5bc74ad.avif?t=1729257086\" width=600 height=334 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912910/extras/728d64c7d842ff482d8a23c52bd3b73a.avif?t=1729257086\" width=540 height=960 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912910/extras/51e741aae7ab185a0016c63ce09d5b00.avif?t=1729257086\" width=564 height=180 /></span><br><br><br>Although an arcade style game, <strong>Shockwave Triggers</strong> offer a console like experience thanks to the different features available:<br>- Difficulties: The game offers 4 levels of difficulty, to each their own.<br>- Tate/Yoko modes: Since the game is a vertical shooter, a Tate mode is a must. The purists can set their monitors vertically and enjoy the true full screen mode, just like on the real arcade hardware.<br>- Controllers and keyboard: The game supports a great range of controllers as well as the keyboard. Players can configure the keys as they wish.<br>- Arcade mode: Play the single player mode and aim for high score on the online leaderboard.<br>- Two coop players mode: Enjoy local multiplayer on shared screen, just like the old good days. <br>- Boss rush: Train and fight against every boss you've already reached.<br>- Gallery: Unlock and enjoy different artworks, concepts and fanarts.<br>- Trophies: Enjoy the challenge of unlocking the many trophies the game offers.<br>- Game shop: Use the in-game earned money and unlock additional credits as well as new features. <br>- Online leaderboard: Take the challenge online and see how high you can get on the online leaderboard.",
